    <string name="settings_kgg_root_guide_content">KuGou keys are stored inside KuGou or in exported key files:
1. Rooted Devices: OpenConverter automatically discovers and synchronizes keys via root access directly — no auxiliary apps needed.
2. Non-Root Devices: NetEase (NCM) and QQ Music (QMC) convert seamlessly without any configuration. For KuGou (KGG), place an exported kgg.key / mggkey file in your Download or Music folder, and OpenConverter will automatically detect and merge it.</string>
